 7. 🧠 Lingo: Perplexity 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Image: OpenAI OpenAI wants AI labs to limit how powerful their models can get "until our ability to understand and monitor AI behavior achieves a certain concrete milestone," chief scientist Jakub Pachocki writes in a weekend blog post .

 His proposal: Set limits based on perplexity. Perplexity measures how well an AI model predicts the next piece of text. Lower perplexity scores = better predictions from the model (charted above). 
 
